    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i've hit a wall. like, a literal ceiling. everything i've made lately just feels like a cheap imitation of who i used to be. it's actually painful to even pick up my instrument now because i know i'm not that person anymore. i'm just watching the decline in real time.",
